how_its_made:
SOLO VIBE CODING
• Front end: Next.js 14 + TypeScript + shadcn/ui, generated fast in Windsurf.
• Login: Privy embedded wallet gives a self-custodial EOA in one click.
• Storage: chat logs and persona JSON pushed to 0G Storage; 
• Asset: encrypted CID is minted as an ERC-7857 iNFT on 0G Chain;
• Compute: Fluence CPU node calls gpt3.5 turbo to analyse the persona
